Assist with the development and maintenance of full-lifecycle implementations of Drupal-based solutions;
Support the website Cybersecurity Project Manager to provide training, layout design, and bulk scripted content migration support for non-compliant websites to Unite Web;
Undertake a feature gap analysis for each non-compliant website and Unite Web;
Develop customized features to help support the migration of each non-compliant website to Unite Web;
Provide post-migration support to each non-compliant website that has migrated to Unite Web;

Bachelor or Master degree;
+5 years of experience in assisting with design, development, implementation, and maintenance in developing Drupal 8 websites is required;
Experience in the development of responsive websites using frameworks (e.g. Bootstrap);
Proficiency coding in PHP/HTML/CSS/JavaScript and other web development tools;
Proficiency in using Git for source control management;
Experience with Agile project development and product delivery;
Experience with REST API integrations, GIT, MySQL, and MariaDB databases;
Ability to use wire-frame and modeling tools;
Knowledge in automated testing, deployment processes, and continuous integration;
Daily rate: between 100-120 USD per day
Location: Remote;

Build, refine, and maintain core features across the full stack, ensuring a polished, high-performance user experience;
Develop and optimize both the company's main application and internal Admin Interfaces (including user management and billing systems);
Implement high-fidelity UI/UX, ensuring pixel-perfect execution of product designs down to the smallest detail;
Cooperate closely with Product Managers and Designers, translating Figma designs into seamless production code;
Collaborate closely with an additional developer and the QA team to ensure smooth integration, high code quality, and flawless deployment;
Design and maintain significant, sensitive, and secure back-end logic and infrastructure;
Take responsibility for maintaining and updating the company’s marketing website, built on WordPress;
Leverage AI tools effectively to accelerate the development lifecycle and optimize delivery speed without compromising quality.

8+ years of development experience, including at least 5-6 years of Full-Stack experience , with a strong and balanced track record in both Frontend and Backend development;
Deep, significant experience with React ;
Significant and hands-on experience with Python OR Java , with the ability to handle complex and sensitive architecture;
Fluent English (B2 or higher), both written and spoken;
Proven ability to deliver pixel-perfect UI with a sharp eye for detail, and extensive experience working with Figma;
Excellent team player with a proven track record of working effectively alongside other developers, QA engineers, and product stakeholders;
Growth mindset with the ability to adapt quickly, deliver results efficiently, and leverage AI-powered tools to maximize productivity.

Experience with the second backend language (Python/Java);
Hands-on experience with Next.js;
Practical experience with WordPress maintenance and customization.

Fixed schedule: Sunday–Thursday, 09:00–18:00 (Asia/Jerusalem, GMT+3);
Fully remote work opportunity;
Inclusive and international environment;

Experiência sólida em desenvolvimento de aplicativos Android;
Conhecimento em linguagens de programação como Java e Kotlin;
Familiaridade com ferramentas de versionamento de código, como Git;
Habilidade em trabalhar com APIs RESTful e integração de serviços;
Capacidade de resolver problemas de forma criativa e eficiente;
Boa comunicação e trabalho em equipe.

Vivência em desenvolvimento de aplicativos para iOS;
Conhecimento em metodologias ágeis, como Scrum ou Kanban;
Experiência com testes automatizados e práticas de DevOps;
Participação em projetos de grande escala ou em ambientes de alta demanda.

Graduação Completa ou em andamento em Ciência da Computação, Engenharia da Computação ou áreas correlatas;
Participação em grupos de tecnologias ou envolvimento com algum tipo de comunidade.
